<section class="creator-layout"><header><span class="eyebrow">THIS IS 1 SWORD AGAINST HEAVEN</span><h2>Build your collection</h2><p>Create an item, then keep going. Your selected type stays ready.</p></header><nav class="swords-nav" aria-label="Import mode"><button type="button" data-action="importTab" data-tab="single">Item Importer</button><button type="button" data-action="importTab" data-tab="mass">Mass Importer</button><button type="button" data-action="importTab" data-tab="world">World Beings</button></nav>{{#if isSingle}}<div class="creator-scroll"><fieldset><legend>Item identity</legend><div class="creator-grid"><label>Destination folder<select name="folder">{{selectOptions folders selected=folder}}</select></label><label>Item type<select name="itemType">{{selectOptions types selected=type}}</select></label><label>Name<input name="name" value="{{name}}" required placeholder="Name your item" autocomplete="off"></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Details</legend><div class="creator-grid">{{{fields}}}</div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Description &amp; abilities</legend><prose-mirror name="system.description" value="{{description}}"></prose-mirror></fieldset><p class="creator-hint">Use Edit last created for artwork, Active Effects, and drag-and-drop weapon mods.</p></div><footer class="creator-footer">{{#if batch}}<details open><summary>Batch queue ({{batch.length}})</summary><ul class="creator-queue">{{#each batch}}<li>{{name}} · {{type}} <button type="button" data-action="removeQueued" data-index="{{index}}">Remove</button></li>{{/each}}</ul><button type="button" data-action="createBatch">Import queued items</button></details>{{/if}}<p role="status" aria-live="polite">{{#if lastName}}Created {{lastName}} · {{count}} this session{{else}}Items are saved to the Items directory.{{/if}}</p><div>{{#if lastName}}<button type="button" data-action="editLast">Edit last created</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="queue">Add to batch</button><button type="submit" class="creator-primary">Create item</button></div></footer>{{else}}<div class="creator-scroll"><fieldset><legend>{{#if isWorld}}World Being stat blocks{{else}}Mass Importer{{/if}}</legend>{{#if isWorld}}<p>Paste complete stat blocks with an uppercase name, HEALTH line, Cultivations, and bracketed item sections. Matching prefers world items, then visible Item compendiums; Microcosmic Orbit searches only Technicks and Magicks. Missing items become placeholders. Multiple complete blocks are supported.</p>{{else}}<ol><li>Choose a format and default item type. For book Traits, choose Rulebook text and Trait.</li><li>Paste complete entries including their numbered headings (for example, 2 4 Adamance). For unnumbered entries, use a Name: heading for each item or a line containing --- between entries.</li><li>Preview and check the count and names. If multiple items appear as one, add separators and preview again.</li><li>Review the editable JSON, then import. The window stays open.</li></ol><div class="creator-grid"><label>Destination folder<select name="folder">{{selectOptions folders selected=folder}}</select></label><label>Format<select name="import.format">{{selectOptions formats selected=importState.format}}</select></label><label>Default item type<select name="import.type">{{selectOptions types selected=importState.type}}</select></label></div>{{/if}}<label>Files (optional, multiple allowed)<input type="file" name="import.files" multiple accept=".json,.csv,.txt"></label><label>Source content<textarea name="import.content" rows="10">{{importState.content}}</textarea></label><button type="button" data-action="previewImport">Preview entries</button></fieldset><p role="status">{{importState.status}}</p>{{#if importState.names}}<fieldset><legend>Detected entries ({{importState.names.length}})</legend><ol>{{#each importState.names}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ol></fieldset>{{/if}}{{#if importState.notes}}<details><summary>Review notes</summary><ul>{{#each importState.notes}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></details>{{/if}}<label>Editable preview (JSON)<textarea name="import.review" rows="16">{{importState.review}}</textarea></label><p>Nothing is created until you press Import preview. Successful entries leave the preview; failed entries remain available to correct.</p></div><footer class="creator-footer"><button type="button" class="creator-primary" data-action="commitImport">Import preview</button></footer>{{/if}}</section>